---
description: Rules for the Danathar/exult fork (Exult, a C++17 Ultima VII engine)
alwaysApply: true
---

Full rules are in `AGENTS.md`; read it first. Critical points:

- Fork rule: work only on `Danathar/exult`. Every `gh` write command passes `--repo Danathar/exult`; PRs target `master`. Never touch `exult/exult`.
- Never commit Ultima VII game data or other copyrighted assets.
- Style: `.clang-format` (tabs, width 4, column limit 132); change only the lines you need.
- Before a PR run `tests/run-unit-tests.sh` and `tests/e2e/run.sh`; sign off commits (`git commit -s`); do not merge.
- New source files carry the GPL header used by the existing files.
